                <head>345. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On September 5, President Eisenhower approved NSC 5612/1, “U.S. Policy in
                    Mainland Southeast Asia.” A partially declassified text is printed in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States–Vietnam Relations, 1945–1967</hi>, Book
                    10, pages 1082–1095.</p>
            </div>
